==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*4 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Le'noir]] spawns as the boss after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Being a stage with low enemy density, heavy hitting [[:Category:Single Attack Cats|Single Attack Cats]] will perform very well here. [[:Category:anti-Dark Cats|Anti-Darks]] such as [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]], [[Talents|Talented]] [[Cats in a Box (Special Cat)|Heavy Assault C.A.T.]]/[[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] and [[Nono (Rare Cat)|Nono]] can also be used for a sure-fire victory.

